            "review_title": "Review at Bang Khuang Cafe",
            "review_text": "Dizdanson\nWakefield, United Kingdom18 contributions\n0\nWonderful\nOct 2017 • Friends\nThis place is on the Third Floor of a fairly non descript building. We wouldn't have found this by accident, local knowledge was required. \nThe place feels very contemporary, quite student like. The food was amazing and the service perfect. It isn't expensive but very few places are in HCMC. \nHighly recommend.\nWritten October 2, 2017",
